--- style sheet: only rules added? ---
new style sheet begins with the whole of the old one: True
   +/* 27 Nov, after a visit at phone size: a long address used as a link's words may break; tables are set smaller on a narrow screen so that their last column is not cut off. */
   +a { overflow-wrap: break-word; }
   +@media (max-width: 520px) {
   +  table { font-size: 0.8rem; }
   +  th, td { padding-right: 0.45rem; }
   +  td.n, th.n { padding-right: 0.4rem; }
   +  th:last-child, td:last-child { padding-right: 0.1rem; }
   +}
   +/* a table still wider than the screen slides sideways; a soft shadow at the edge shows that there is more that way */
   +.tablewrap { background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--surface) 30%, rgba(252,252,251,0)) 0 0, linear-gradient(to left, var(--surface) 30%, rgba(252,252,251,0)) 100% 0, radial-gradient(farthest-side at 0 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0.32), 
